{"title": "Japanese Prime Minister Visits India for Annual Summit", "summary": "Japanese Prime Minister Sanae Takaichi has arrived in New Delhi for a three-day official visit, marking her first trip to India. She is scheduled to hold talks with Indian Prime Minister Narendra Modi during the 16th India-Japan annual summit. The visit was extended at Prime Minister Modi's invitation.", "summary_points": ["Japanese Prime Minister Sanae Takaichi arrived in New Delhi.", "This is her first official visit to India.", "She will participate in the 16th India-Japan annual summit.", "Prime Minister Takaichi will hold talks with Indian Prime Minister Narendra Modi.", "The visit is scheduled to last for three days.", "The visit was extended at Prime Minister Modi's invitation."], "title_hi": "जापान की प्रधानमंत्री भारत की वार्षिक शिखर बैठक के लिए पहुंचीं", "summary_hi": "जापान की प्रधानमंत्री सनाए ताकाइसी तीन दिवसीय आधिकारिक यात्रा पर नई दिल्ली पहुंची हैं, जो भारत की उनकी पहली यात्रा है। वह 16वीं भारत-जापान वार्षिक शिखर बैठक के दौरान भारतीय प्रधानमंत्री नरेंद्र मोदी के साथ वार्ता करेंगी। यह यात्रा प्रधानमंत्री मोदी के निमंत्रण पर हुई है।", "summary_points_hi": ["जापान की प्रधानमंत्री सनाए ताकाइसी नई दिल्ली पहुंचीं।", "यह भारत की उनकी पहली आधिकारिक यात्रा है।", "वह 16वीं भारत-जापान वार्षिक शिखर बैठक में भाग लेंगी।", "प्रधानमंत्री ताकाइसी भारतीय प्रधानमंत्री नरेंद्र मोदी के साथ वार्ता करेंगी।", "यह यात्रा तीन दिनों तक चलेगी।", "यह यात्रा प्रधानमंत्री मोदी के निमंत्रण पर हुई है।"], "framing": {"left": "Left-leaning outlets focus on the official nature of the visit, noting it is the Japanese Prime Minister's first trip to India and highlighting the scheduled annual summit and talks.", "center": "Centrist coverage emphasizes the arrival of the Japanese Prime Minister in Delhi and the upcoming talks with Prime Minister Modi, with some outlets quoting Modi's welcoming remarks.", "right": "Right-leaning outlets highlight the \"high-stakes\" nature of the New Delhi talks and mention the J